              798.0,
              1548.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "This will require extensive experience in senior leadership roles within international organizations focusing on Latin America and the Caribbean. Naturally, you will be capable of thinking strategically and developing innovative solutions to meet diverse clients' needs, adept at forging partnerships across countries and sectors, and skilled in building successful teams with a strong client service orientation. Finally, it is essential that you are fully fluent in English, preferably backed by proficiency in Spanish and some knowledge of French and Portuguese.\nPlease send the complete job description and apply via jobs.iadb.org (reference 2300000972) before 15 December, 2023.",
